        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to CUBES GO – Where Classic Block Elimination Meets Strategic Evolution!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into a dimension that redefines block-matching! Cubes Go transforms timeless puzzle fun into a dynamic 3D arena, powered by a deep, strategic Skill Tree system. This isn’t just about reflexes—it’s a journey of strategic growth, meaningful choices, and earth-shattering power!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tailor Your Elimination Playstyle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge your own path with strategic upgrades:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>→ Demolition Expert? Unlock instant screen-clearing Nuclear Strikes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>→ Survival Master? Earn Extra Lives and achieve Infinite Survival.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>→ Resource King? Multiply Skill Points with Score Boosts and chain combos!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every upgrade matters. Every choice defines your power.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feel the Rush of Progression</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Witness your evolution from struggle to dominance! Early challenges melt away as you:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>→ Obliterate threats with planet-shaking explosions.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>→ Reverse impossible odds with life-saving upgrades.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>→ Dominate the grid through calculated power growth.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is the core thrill of Cubes Go: From Zero to Hero.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash Climactic Destruction</strong></